# Sowing Mycospawn's search is a trigger "when you cast this spell", independent of the spell on the stack (CR 603.2): Bot2 counters the
# Mycospawn with Counterspell while the search trigger is above it, and the trigger still resolves; Bot1 gets its Island onto the
# battlefield though the creature goes to the graveyard.

